  diffusion for image and video generation\, making them a natural fit for 
 streaming and interactive video world models. However\, because they gener
 ate content step by step and condition on their own previous outputs\, the
 y remain vulnerable to exposure bias —where early errors propagate and s
 hape the entire generation process. In this…\nhttps://hi-paris.fr/event/
 ai-seminar-cycle-when-generators-condition-on-themselves-exposure-bias-in-
 visual-autoregressive-models/
